      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1768141459560,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "→ Idempotent, even if we used POST, insert would fail at the DB level (due to Primary\nkey unique constraint).\n→ But would result in a failure in the API call.\n\n→ DELETE is right way to solve unfollowing, but not in scope of design",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jiekSUidM_ncPmK4qEXYn",
      "originalText": "→ Idempotent, even if we used POST, insert would fail at the DB level (due to Primary key unique constraint).\n→ But would result in a failure in the API call.\n\n→ DELETE is right way to solve unfollowing, but not in scope of design",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
